OL,3,ATrump threatens 'tremendous economic
OL,4,Aconsequences' on any country helping
OL,5,AIran
OL,6,
OL,7,FPresident Donald Trump has announced
OL,8,Fthe US will inflict "TREMENDOUS
OL,9,FEconomic Consequences" on any country
OL,10,Fthat helps or does business with Iran.
OL,12,FHe wrote in all capital letters on
OL,13,FTruth Social he was launching "the most
OL,14,Fcrushing economic operation ever taken
OL,15,Fagainst any country!" He gave no
OL,16,Ffurther details, and did not name any
OL,17,Fother nation.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
