OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ASecond day of mushroom murderer Erin
OL,4,APatterson's appeal hearing under way in
OL,5,AMelbourne
OL,6,
OL,7,FThey say a blunder that saw the jury
OL,8,Faccidentally stay in the same hotel as
OL,9,Fsome prosecutors and a key witness was
OL,10,F"catastrophic" for the integrity of the
OL,11,Ftrial, and that several pieces of
OL,12,Fevidence were misused
OL,14,FProsecutors argue that the jury mishap
OL,15,Fwas a symptom of the frenzy surrounding
OL,16,Fthe town during the trial, and that
OL,17,Fthere is no evidence the jurors were
OL,18,Finfluenced improperly
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
